title: "One daily care task as caregivers complete it"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: open
    lg1: closed
    lg2: gone
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 tan
  s0: Due day 0, today is day 0 (nothing done yet)
  s1: Task deleted
  s2: Due day 0, today is day 1 (nothing done yet)
  s3: Due day 0, today is day 2 (nothing done yet)
  s4: Due day 1, today is day 0 (done: day 0)
  s5: Due day 1, today is day 1 (done: day 0)
  s6: Task closed (done: day 0, day 1)
  s7: Due day 1, today is day 2 (done: day 0)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a caregiver deletes the task (or its only cat)
  s0 --> s2: a new day begins
  s2 --> s1: a caregiver deletes the task (or its only cat)
  s2 --> s3: a new day begins
  s0 --> s4: the task list's Complete (row or sheet) saves a completion for day 0
  s3 --> s1: a caregiver deletes the task (or its only cat)
  s2 --> s5: the task list's Complete (row or sheet) saves a completion for day 0
  s4 --> s1: a caregiver deletes the task (or its only cat)
  s4 --> s5: a new day begins
  s3 --> s7: the task list's Complete (row or sheet) saves a completion for day 0
  s5 --> s1: a caregiver deletes the task (or its only cat)
  s5 --> s7: a new day begins
  s4 --> s6: the task list's Complete (row or sheet) saves a completion for day 1
  s6 --> s1: a caregiver deletes the task (or its only cat)
  s7 --> s1: a caregiver deletes the task (or its only cat)
  s5 --> s6: the task list's Complete (row or sheet) saves a completion for day 1
  s7 --> s6: the task list's Complete (row or sheet) saves a completion for day 1
